#: ../../source/pulse.rst:2
msgid "Pulse envelopes"
msgstr "脉冲包络"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:4
msgid ""
":mod:`quspect.pulse` builds and decodes time-domain control envelopes for"
" superconducting-qubit experiments: DRAG-shaped drive pulses, flat-top "
"readout and flux pulses, arbitrary sampled waveforms, and whole pulse "
"schedules made from them."
msgstr ""
":mod:`quspect.pulse` 用于构建和解码超导量子比特实验中的时域控制包络：DRAG "
"驱动脉冲、平顶读取与磁通脉冲、任意采样波形，以及由它们组成的完整脉冲序列。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:9
msgid ""
"The module is a C++ reimplementation of the extension module of "
"`envelopes-qc <https://pypi.org/project/envelopes-qc/>`_ 0.1.5.  It keeps"
" the same classes, function signatures, docstrings and behaviour, and "
"decoded waveforms are **bit-identical** to the original: every "
"``float32`` sample, the serialization bytes, ``repr`` strings and error "
"messages match.  Unlike the original, it is built from source on every "
"supported platform, including Linux on aarch64."
msgstr ""
"该模块是 `envelopes-qc <https://pypi.org/project/envelopes-qc/>`_ 0.1.5 扩展模块的"
" C++ 重新实现。它保留了相同的类、函数签名、文档字符串和行为，解码出的波形与原实现\\ **逐位一致**\\ ：每个 ``float32`` "
"采样点、序列化字节、``repr`` 字符串和错误消息都相同。与原实现不同，它在所有受支持的平台上都从源码构建，包括 aarch64 架构的 "
"Linux。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:17
msgid ""
"The classes and functions are re-exported from the native extension "
"``quspect._pulse``.  Importing :mod:`quspect.pulse` raises "
":class:`ImportError` when the extension has not been built (see "
":doc:`installation`)."
msgstr ""
"这些类和函数由原生扩展 ``quspect._pulse`` 重新导出。若扩展尚未构建，导入 :mod:`quspect.pulse` 会抛出 "
":class:`ImportError`\\ （参见 :doc:`installation`）。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:22
msgid "Quick example"
msgstr "快速示例"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:40
msgid ""
"Times are in the unit of the cache resolution (usually ns); frequencies "
"are in the reciprocal unit (GHz for ns)."
msgstr "时间的单位与缓存分辨率相同（通常为 ns）；频率使用其倒数单位（时间单位为 ns 时即 GHz）。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:44
msgid "Envelope types"
msgstr "包络类型"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:50
msgid "Class"
msgstr "类"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:51
msgid "Constructor"
msgstr "构造参数"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:52
msgid "Shape"
msgstr "形状"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:53
msgid "``Gaussian``"
msgstr "``Gaussian``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:54
msgid "``(t0, w, amp)``"
msgstr "``(t0, w, amp)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:55
msgid ""
"Gaussian centred at ``t0`` with full width at half maximum ``w``, "
"truncated to ``t0 ± 3w``."
msgstr "以 ``t0`` 为中心、半高全宽为 ``w`` 的高斯函数，截断在 ``t0 ± 3w``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:57
msgid "``GaussianDRAG``"
msgstr "``GaussianDRAG``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:58 ../../source/pulse.rst:62
msgid "``(t0, w, amp, coef, df, phase)``"
msgstr "``(t0, w, amp, coef, df, phase)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:59
msgid ""
"Gaussian plus ``i·coef`` times its derivative (DRAG), modulated by "
"``exp(i(-2π·df·t + phase))``.  Complex."
msgstr "高斯函数加上 ``i·coef`` 乘以其导数（DRAG），再乘以调制因子 ``exp(i(-2π·df·t + phase))``。复数包络。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:61
msgid "``CosineDRAG``"
msgstr "``CosineDRAG``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:63
msgid ""
"Raised cosine of full width ``w`` with DRAG correction and modulation. "
"Complex."
msgstr "全宽为 ``w`` 的升余弦，带 DRAG 修正和调制。复数包络。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:65
msgid "``Triangle``"
msgstr "``Triangle``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:66
msgid "``(t0, tlen, amp, fall)``"
msgstr "``(t0, tlen, amp, fall)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:67
msgid "Linear ramp over ``[t0, t0 + tlen)``, falling or rising."
msgstr "在 ``[t0, t0 + tlen)`` 上的线性斜坡，可下降或上升。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:68
msgid "``Rect``"
msgstr "``Rect``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:69
msgid "``(t0, tlen, amp)``"
msgstr "``(t0, tlen, amp)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:70
msgid "Rectangle over ``[t0, t0 + tlen)``."
msgstr "在 ``[t0, t0 + tlen)`` 上的矩形。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:71
msgid "``Flattop``"
msgstr "``Flattop``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:72
msgid "``(t0, tlen, w_left, w_right, amp)``"
msgstr "``(t0, tlen, w_left, w_right, amp)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:73
msgid "Rectangle whose edges are convolved with Gaussian kernels."
msgstr "两侧边沿分别与高斯核卷积的矩形。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:74
msgid "``RippleRect``"
msgstr "``RippleRect``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:75
msgid "``(t0, tlen, amp, w, ripple0, ..., ripple3)``"
msgstr "``(t0, tlen, amp, w, ripple0, ..., ripple3)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:76
msgid "Gaussian-smoothed rectangle with four sinusoidal ripple terms."
msgstr "经高斯平滑并叠加四个正弦纹波项的矩形。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:77
msgid "``PowerSineCosine``"
msgstr "``PowerSineCosine``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:78
msgid "``(t0, tlen, amp, m, n, k, phase)``"
msgstr "``(t0, tlen, amp, m, n, k, phase)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:79
msgid "``sin(kπt/T + phase)^m · cos(kπt/T + phase)^n``."
msgstr "``sin(kπt/T + phase)^m · cos(kπt/T + phase)^n``."

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:80
msgid "``GaussianXPower``"
msgstr "``GaussianXPower``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:81
msgid "``(t0, w, amp, m)``"
msgstr "``(t0, w, amp, m)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:82
msgid "Gaussian multiplied by ``x^m``."
msgstr "高斯函数乘以 ``x^m``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:83
msgid "``Custom``"
msgstr "``Custom``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:84
msgid "``(start, dt, data)``"
msgstr "``(start, dt, data)``"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:85
msgid ""
"Arbitrary real or complex samples spaced by ``dt``, linearly interpolated"
" onto the decoding grid."
msgstr "以 ``dt`` 为间隔的任意实数或复数采样点，线性插值到解码网格上。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:88
msgid ""
"``amp`` is stored as ``float32``.  Every envelope exposes ``start()``, "
"``end()``, ``is_complex()`` and ``copy()``."
msgstr ""
"``amp`` 以 ``float32`` 存储。每个包络都提供 ``start()``、``end()``、``is_complex()`` 和"
" ``copy()``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:92
msgid "Composing envelopes"
msgstr "组合包络"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:94
msgid "Envelopes form expression trees:"
msgstr "包络组成表达式树："

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:96
msgid ""
"``a + b`` builds an ``EnvSum``; adding ``0`` returns the envelope itself,"
" so the built-in :func:`sum` works.  ``s += env`` appends to an existing "
"``EnvSum`` in place."
msgstr ""
"``a + b`` 构建一个 ``EnvSum``；加 ``0`` 返回包络本身，因此可以使用内置的 :func:`sum`。``s += "
"env`` 原地追加到已有的 ``EnvSum``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:99
msgid ""
"``env * c`` scales by a real (``RealEnvProd``) or complex "
"(``COMPLEXEnvProd``) constant stored in single precision."
msgstr "``env * c`` 乘以以单精度存储的实数常数（``RealEnvProd``）或复数常数（``COMPLEXEnvProd``）。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:101
msgid ""
"``env >> dt`` shifts in time (``EnvShift``).  Shifts and scales are "
"pushed through sums, so ``(a + b) >> dt`` is ``(a >> dt) + (b >> dt)``."
msgstr ""
"``env >> dt`` 在时间上平移（``EnvShift``）。平移和缩放会下推到求和的各项，因此 ``(a + b) >> dt`` 等于"
" ``(a >> dt) + (b >> dt)``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:103
msgid ""
"``mix(env, df, phase, dynamical)`` applies sideband mixing.  With "
"``dynamical=True`` the carrier phase is zero at ``t = 0``; with "
"``dynamical=False`` it is zero at the shifted start of each copy."
msgstr ""
"``mix(env, df, phase, dynamical)`` 进行边带混频。``dynamical=True`` 时载波相位在 ``t ="
" 0`` 处为零；``dynamical=False`` 时在每个副本平移后的起点处为零。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:106
msgid ""
"``align(env, dt, amp=None)`` places copies of ``env`` at the offsets "
"``dt``, optionally scaled by real (``float32``) or complex "
"(``complex64``) amplitudes.  It is much faster than summing shifted "
"copies in Python."
msgstr ""
"``align(env, dt, amp=None)`` 将 ``env`` 的副本放置在偏移 ``dt`` "
"处，并可选地乘以实数（``float32``）或复数（``complex64``）幅度。它比在 Python 中对平移后的副本求和快得多。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:109
msgid ""
"``split(env, starts, ends)`` distributes the terms of a sum into blocks. "
"Each term must lie completely inside a block; empty blocks get a zero-"
"length ``Rect``."
msgstr ""
"``split(env, starts, ends)`` 将求和的各项分配到各个分块中。每一项必须完全位于某个分块内；空分块会得到一个长度为零的 "
"``Rect``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:126
msgid "Decoding"
msgstr "解码"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:128
msgid ""
"``decode_envelope(env, wc)`` samples an envelope and returns "
"``(start_time, wave)``, where ``wave`` is a ``float32`` array for real "
"envelopes and ``complex64`` for complex ones.  Samples lie on the "
"absolute grid ``n · resolution`` of the "
":class:`~quspect.pulse.WaveCache`, and the array is a fresh buffer that "
"may be modified in place."
msgstr ""
"``decode_envelope(env, wc)`` 对包络采样并返回 ``(start_time, wave)``，其中实数包络的 "
"``wave`` 为 ``float32`` 数组，复数包络为 ``complex64`` 数组。采样点位于 "
":class:`~quspect.pulse.WaveCache` 的绝对网格 ``n · resolution`` "
"上，返回的数组是新分配的缓冲区，可以原地修改。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:134
msgid ""
"``decode_envelope(env, wc, start, end)`` crops or zero-pads the result to"
" the window ``[start, end)``.  The returned start time is ``start`` "
"rounded to ``1e-5``, **not** snapped to the sample grid; the first sample"
" is the grid point nearest to it.  A ``start`` after the envelope's last "
"sample or an ``end`` before its first sample raises "
":class:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr ""
"``decode_envelope(env, wc, start, end)`` 将结果裁剪或补零到窗口 ``[start, "
"end)``。返回的起始时间是按 ``1e-5`` 取整后的 ``start``，\\ **而不是**\\ "
"对齐到采样网格；第一个采样点是离它最近的网格点。若 ``start`` 晚于包络的最后一个采样点，或 ``end`` 早于第一个采样点，会抛出 "
":class:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:140
msgid ""
"A :class:`~quspect.pulse.WaveCache` stores the base waveform of each "
"envelope shape per sub-grid offset, so decoding many copies of the same "
"pulse computes the shape only once.  Reuse one cache across decodes with "
"the same resolution."
msgstr ""
":class:`~quspect.pulse.WaveCache` "
"按网格内偏移存储每种包络形状的基础波形，因此解码同一脉冲的多个副本时形状只计算一次。分辨率相同的多次解码请复用同一个缓存。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:146
msgid "Serialization"
msgstr "序列化"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:148
msgid ""
"``serialization(env)`` returns a compact binary encoding of the "
"expression tree and ``deserialization(data)`` restores it; shared sub-"
"trees are stored once.  The format is byte-compatible with envelopes-qc "
"0.1.5.  All envelope classes support :mod:`pickle` through the same "
"encoding."
msgstr ""
"``serialization(env)`` 返回表达式树的紧凑二进制编码，``deserialization(data)`` "
"将其还原；共享的子树只存储一次。该格式与 envelopes-qc 0.1.5 字节兼容。所有包络类都通过同一编码支持 "
":mod:`pickle`。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:154
msgid "Differences from envelopes-qc"
msgstr "与 envelopes-qc 的差异"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:156
msgid ""
"Import from :mod:`quspect.pulse` instead of ``envelopes.evc``.  The class"
" names and call signatures are unchanged."
msgstr "从 :mod:`quspect.pulse` 导入，而不是 ``envelopes.evc``。类名和调用签名保持不变。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:158
msgid ""
"The pure-Python reference implementation ``envelopes.evp`` is not "
"included."
msgstr "不包含纯 Python 参考实现 ``envelopes.evp``。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:160
msgid ""
"Inputs that crash or hang envelopes-qc 0.1.5 raise Python exceptions "
"instead, or work as expected:"
msgstr "会让 envelopes-qc 0.1.5 崩溃或卡死的输入，在这里会抛出 Python 异常，或按预期工作："

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:163
msgid ""
"``start()``, ``end()`` or decoding of an empty ``EnvSum`` (for example "
"``align(env, [])``) raises :class:`RuntimeError`;"
msgstr ""
"对空 ``EnvSum``（例如 ``align(env, [])``）调用 ``start()``、``end()`` 或解码会抛出 "
":class:`RuntimeError`；"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:165
msgid ""
"``mix()`` and ``copy()`` of a real-scaled complex envelope, such as "
"``mix(GaussianDRAG(...) * 2, ...)``, return the expected result;"
msgstr ""
"对乘以实数常数的复数包络调用 ``mix()`` 和 ``copy()``，例如 ``mix(GaussianDRAG(...) * 2, "
"...)``，会返回预期结果；"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:167
msgid "``s += s`` on an ``EnvSum`` appends its own terms;"
msgstr "对 ``EnvSum`` 执行 ``s += s`` 会追加它自身的各项；"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:168
msgid "passing ``None`` as an envelope raises :class:`TypeError`;"
msgstr "将 ``None`` 作为包络传入会抛出 :class:`TypeError`；"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:169
msgid "truncated or corrupted serialized data raises :class:`RuntimeError`."
msgstr "截断或损坏的序列化数据会抛出 :class:`RuntimeError`。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:171
msgid ""
"Compatibility is checked by ``tools/pulse_compat``, which runs the same "
"cases against envelopes-qc and :mod:`quspect.pulse` and compares the "
"results byte for byte, and by golden values in ``tests/pulse``."
msgstr ""
"兼容性由 ``tools/pulse_compat`` 检查：它对 envelopes-qc 和 :mod:`quspect.pulse` "
"运行同一批用例并逐字节比较结果；``tests/pulse`` 中的黄金值也会参与校验。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:175
msgid ""
"Output is bit-identical to envelopes-qc on macOS arm64.  On other "
"platforms everything is identical as well, except the samples of "
"envelopes built on the real error function "
"(:class:`~quspect.pulse.Flattop` and :class:`~quspect.pulse.RippleRect`):"
" ``erf`` comes from the platform C library, whose last bit differs "
"between implementations, so these samples may differ from envelopes-qc on"
" macOS by about one ``float32`` ulp.  Their serialization bytes are "
"identical on every platform."
msgstr ""
"在 macOS arm64 上，输出与 envelopes-qc 逐位一致。在其他平台上同样一致，"
"唯一的例外是基于实数误差函数构造的包络（:class:`~quspect.pulse.Flattop` "
"和 :class:`~quspect.pulse.RippleRect`）的采样值：``erf`` 来自平台 C 库，"
"不同实现在最后一位上存在差异，因此这些采样值与 macOS 上 envelopes-qc "
"的结果可能相差约一个 ``float32`` ulp。它们的序列化字节在所有平台上都相同。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:184
msgid "Using quspect.pulse in place of envelopes-qc"
msgstr "用 quspect.pulse 替代 envelopes-qc"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:186
msgid ""
"Code written against envelopes-qc imports ``from envelopes import evc``."
"  The pulse-sequence layer of the ``lqcloud`` SDK is an example. "
":func:`quspect.pulse.use_as_envelopes` temporarily registers a stand-in "
"``envelopes`` package whose ``evc`` is :mod:`quspect.pulse`'s native "
"module, so such code runs on this implementation without envelopes-qc "
"installed:"
msgstr ""
"基于 envelopes-qc 编写的代码会执行 ``from envelopes import evc``\\ ，``lqcloud`` SDK"
" 的脉冲序列层就是一个例子。:func:`quspect.pulse.use_as_envelopes` 会临时注册一个替身 "
"``envelopes`` 包，其 ``evc`` 指向 :mod:`quspect.pulse` 的原生模块，因此这类代码无需安装 "
"envelopes-qc 即可运行在本实现上："

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:203
msgid ""
"For a whole application, call :func:`quspect.pulse.install_as_envelopes` "
"once at start-up instead.  In tests, wrap the context manager in a "
"fixture; ``tests/pulse/conftest.py`` provides ``envelopes_shim``."
msgstr ""
"若要让整个应用都使用本实现，请改为在启动时调用一次 :func:`quspect.pulse.install_as_envelopes`\\ "
"。在测试中，可以把上下文管理器包装成 fixture；``tests/pulse/conftest.py`` 提供了 "
"``envelopes_shim``\\ 。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:207
msgid ""
"This is safe because decoded waveforms and serialization bytes are bit-"
"identical to envelopes-qc 0.1.5.  Envelopes built here and serialized by "
"``lqcloud`` are read correctly by services that deserialize them with "
"envelopes-qc."
msgstr ""
"这样做是安全的：解码出的波形和序列化字节都与 envelopes-qc 0.1.5 逐位一致。在这里构建、由 ``lqcloud`` "
"序列化的包络，可以被使用 envelopes-qc 反序列化的服务正确读取。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:212
msgid "Keep in mind:"
msgstr "注意事项："

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:214
msgid ""
"The stand-in must be active **before** the consumer imports its envelope "
"modules, because they bind ``evc`` at import time.  Cached modules named "
"in ``purge`` (``lqcloud`` by default) are dropped on entry so they are "
"re-imported against the stand-in.  When the block exits, everything in "
":data:`sys.modules` is restored."
msgstr ""
"替身必须在使用方导入其包络模块\\ **之前**\\ 生效，因为这些模块会在导入时绑定 ``evc``\\ 。进入时会清除 ``purge`` "
"中列出的已缓存模块（默认为 ``lqcloud``\\ ），使它们针对替身重新导入。退出代码块时，:data:`sys.modules` "
"中的所有相关条目都会恢复原状。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:219
msgid ""
"Objects from the two implementations are different C++ types and cannot "
"be mixed.  Pass only :mod:`quspect.pulse` envelopes to code imported "
"under the stand-in."
msgstr "两种实现的对象属于不同的 C++ 类型，不能混用。对在替身下导入的代码，只能传入 :mod:`quspect.pulse` 的包络。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:222
msgid "``envelopes.evp`` (the pure-Python implementation) is not provided."
msgstr "不提供 ``envelopes.evp``\\ （纯 Python 实现）。"

#: ../../source/pulse.rst:223
msgid ""
"``lqcloud`` declares envelopes-qc as a dependency, and envelopes-qc has "
"no linux/aarch64 wheel.  On that platform install it with ``pip install "
"--no-deps lqcloud`` plus its other dependencies."
msgstr ""
"``lqcloud`` 把 envelopes-qc 声明为依赖，而 envelopes-qc 没有 linux/aarch64 的 "
"wheel。在该平台上请使用 ``pip install --no-deps lqcloud`` 安装，并另行安装其他依赖。"

